    <div>
      <p>PEREGRINE is the experimental flight program that exercises this archival capability. Flights, failures, recoveries, maintenance, aircraft state, source imagery, and the decision not to fly all remain part of the record.</p>
      <p>As <strong>A THING DOCUMENTED IS A THING NOT YET LOST</strong> governs L'ARCHIVE, <strong>ALTITUDE IN FLIGHT AS VERTICAL PERSPECTIVE</strong> governs the UAV Division. The line defines the instrument's purpose: ascend so relationships that are hidden at ground level can enter the record.</p>
